{"blocks": [{"block_id": "NTs", "elements": [{"elements": [{"text": "libbitcoin v3.3.0 has been tagged as release", "type": "text"}], "type": "rich_text_section"}], "type": "rich_text"}], "text": "libbitcoin v3.3.0 has been tagged as release", "ts": "1502567318.928687", "type": "message", "user": "U6N3S6GPQ", "user_profile": {"display_name": "evoskuil", "name": "evoskuil", "real_name": "Eric Voskuil"}},
{"blocks": [{"block_id": "ZZric", "elements": [{"elements": [{"text": "This includes configurable support for check-sequence-verify bips: 68/112/113 as well as a new config setting to specify invalid peer services...", "type": "text"}], "type": "rich_text_section"}], "type": "rich_text"}], "text": "This includes configurable support for check-sequence-verify bips: 68/112/113 as well as a new config setting to specify invalid peer services...", "ts": "1502567383.933724", "type": "message", "user": "U6N3S6GPQ", "user_profile": {"display_name": "evoskuil", "name": "evoskuil", "real_name": "Eric Voskuil"}},
{"blocks": [{"block_id": "ggRa", "elements": [{"elements": [{"text": "This allows the operator to disconnect peers using invalid service flags to advertise hard fork intentions.", "type": "text"}], "type": "rich_text_section"}], "type": "rich_text"}], "text": "This allows the operator to disconnect peers using invalid service flags to advertise hard fork intentions.", "ts": "1502567434.937938", "type": "message", "user": "U6N3S6GPQ", "user_profile": {"display_name": "evoskuil", "name": "evoskuil", "real_name": "Eric Voskuil"}},
{"blocks": [{"block_id": "PJvFr", "elements": [{"elements": [{"text": "I have no plans personally to implement segwit in version3 as this would require rewriting much of it for version4...", "type": "text"}], "type": "rich_text_section"}], "type": "rich_text"}], "text": "I have no plans personally to implement segwit in version3 as this would require rewriting much of it for version4...", "ts": "1502567495.942874", "type": "message", "user": "U6N3S6GPQ", "user_profile": {"display_name": "evoskuil", "name": "evoskuil", "real_name": "Eric Voskuil"}},
{"blocks": [{"block_id": "CQ0Xb", "elements": [{"elements": [{"text": "As a result version4 may ship without a couple of the intended initial features so that segwit can make the EOY release target.", "type": "text"}], "type": "rich_text_section"}], "type": "rich_text"}], "text": "As a result version4 may ship without a couple of the intended initial features so that segwit can make the EOY release target.", "ts": "1502567547.947307", "type": "message", "user": "U6N3S6GPQ", "user_profile": {"display_name": "evoskuil", "name": "evoskuil", "real_name": "Eric Voskuil"}},
{"blocks": [{"block_id": "Eufjv", "elements": [{"elements": [{"text": "As soon as the current version4 node/blockchain/database work is operational it will be merged to master for testing. I expect that to be a few weeks.", "type": "text"}], "type": "rich_text_section"}], "type": "rich_text"}], "text": "As soon as the current version4 node/blockchain/database work is operational it will be merged to master for testing. I expect that to be a few weeks.", "ts": "1502567678.957643", "type": "message", "user": "U6N3S6GPQ", "user_profile": {"display_name": "evoskuil", "name": "evoskuil", "real_name": "Eric Voskuil"}},
